Scope disclaimer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software prepares an informational claim file. It does not provide legal
advice, does not represent the passenger, and guarantees no compensation. The
EU261 rules implemented here are deliberately simplified and do not replace a
legal analysis.
